-    clip with ``T`` RGB frames the adapter chooses the largest supported
-    ``1 + 4*n`` suffix and returns exactly ``n + 1`` latent steps.  No logical
-    t=1/t=3 placeholders are inserted when the VAE only produced t=0..t=2.
